Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.14,0:00:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Morioh Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As usual, this is your host, Kai Harada,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keeping you company on this fine morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've got just the song\Nto start you off right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's dig in, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but before we begin, I have\Na little something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.10,0:01:24.27,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}taisetsu na mono ubawaresou
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.10,0:01:24.27,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}Something important is being taken from me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.69,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}nichijou ni magirekonda akuma
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.27,0:01:26.69,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HFAF2ED&}By a demon that's thrust itself into my life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.06,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion nara tokkuni kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.06,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}Everything is crumbling around me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.69,0:01:30.06,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HC4B3D4&}heion na toki kuzuresatteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.32,0:01:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I just share with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.86,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}nanigenai soshite sarigenai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.69,0:01:32.86,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Living my life as if everything was fine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.76,0:01:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do with myself?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.24,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}kizu ga nai uchi ni ubawareteita
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.86,0:01:35.24,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}Until suddenly it was stolen away without warning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.24,0:01:38.70,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}torikaeshi ni iku nara ima sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.24,0:01:38.70,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HECEEEE&}This is my only chance to take it back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a huge dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.03,0:01:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's a giant bolt.
