Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.70,0:01:43.04,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Those who fight with a heart pierced by the arrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's a giant bolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a giant bolt.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.04,0:01:46.54,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}butsukeau kokoro wa utsukushii
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.04,0:01:46.54,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HF8E3D2&}Are a beautiful sight to behold
