Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.09,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}nigeba wa nai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.09,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}You can't escape me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.09,0:01:57.76,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}hashiridase chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.09,0:01:57.76,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Run faster as I chase you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chase you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:01:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chase you tomorrow!
