Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.89,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Even tomorrow I'll chase you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.89,0:02:02.76,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}tataki tsukete yaru no sa
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.89,0:02:02.76,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&HD6ECF9&}Until I finally pummel you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll change the future!
