Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.76,0:02:08.39,Part 4 OP2 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}My perseverance will propel me forward to achieve victory
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.76,0:02:08.39,Part 4 OP2 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&&HEEF7F1&&}shouhai wo wakeru nowa shuunen sa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.34,0:02:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll change the future!
