Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.32,0:02:20.91,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(143,900)\fs60}Episode 21: {\fs80} Kira Yoshikage Wants a Quiet Life, Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.32,0:02:20.91,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(143,900)\fs60}Episode 21: {\fs80} Kira Yoshikage Wants a Quiet Life Part 1
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.20,0:02:19.57,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mr. Kira? Umm, Mr. Kira?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.58,0:02:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For last minute but would you be\Ninterested in getting lunch with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies, but I must decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to finish delivering these\Ndocuments before the day gets away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your time on\Nhim. He'd suck the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of the party the guys\Nand I invite him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On occasion but we can never tell\Nif he's having fun or hates us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira age 33. Every single.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a model employee,\Nthat's for damn sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the guy's dull as dishwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that he's necessarily\Na tool or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just kind of blah, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's a little bent out of shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some new girls at work\Ninvited me to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, it's as innocent as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I promised you lunch\Nwas our time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never go back in my word\Njust to fraternize with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me turn them down, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the time we've known each other,\NI've never left you by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop this silly fretting and\Nlet's pick out some sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, which one do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one has a delicate texture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.28,0:03:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bakery's one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sandwiches with\Nbread made fresh at 11 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all the rage around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be lucky to find one\Non the shelf after 1 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even through the wrapper, you can\Nfeel they're fresh from the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:04:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The katsu they use is always\Nfreshly fried and perfectly crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems in all the excitement, you managed\Nto tear the wrapper and make a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a naughty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a waste, but this\Nsandwich is ruined now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll just\Nbuy the one underneath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for dropping by.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quaint little Mario between us, it might\Nbe the most marvelous town on earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:05:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like we're on a romantic picnic,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aromatic for? my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time for the\Ntwo of us to part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end is close at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If luck is on my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps I'll cross paths with a beautiful\Nnew girl visiting from out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh joy, it's a mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:05:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and Okuyasu, good\Nto see you! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you got here\Njust in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get right to the point, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to borrow some lunch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a little strapped\Nfor cash at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the money we\Ngot from the lottery ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it gone already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We put all that in the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you gotta be crazy\Nif you think we go all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the way to the bank just\Nto get some munch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth the walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thousand yen should be\Nenough for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.94,0:06:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, as soon as school's over,\Nwe'll head to the bank and pay you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know that logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a sandwich from St.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought they were sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are, and you're not getting a\Nsingle bite of mine, you got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you leave my sandwich alone,\NI'll lend you guys the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet, I can taste their lunch already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just so you know,\NI'm writing an I .O .U.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for this little loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna weasel out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.33,0:07:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the biggest weasel there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, June 24th, lend\N1,000 yen to needy friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.52,0:07:08.82,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}Anyway, thanks again for helping us out, Shigechi! {I'm pretty sure Shigechi never helped them out before, so it should be thanks again for helping instead of thanks for helping again?}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.45,0:07:10.70,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on. Lent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you write the\Ncharacter for Lent again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.68,0:07:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll work for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Hiragana's better than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crud, monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to write\NJosuke or Okuyasu either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sandwich was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sandwich is safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.86,0:07:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember it being this far\Naway. Hey, but at least I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Th-that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Josuke Okuyasu, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:08:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your thumb prints on my\NI .O .U to make it official!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.14,0:08:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lump of a brat\Ngrabbed my back by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, could you be any more annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would we give you our thumbprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cut your thumb with a\Nknife and use the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.48,0:08:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sign the IOU and we'll call it good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, but let's haul ass to St.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman before they sell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him see what's in that bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still wearing the ring I\Nput on her finger this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has my fingerprints on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when the police open an investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be just a matter of time\Nbefore they trace it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshikage Kira has been\Nat this for 15 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in all that time, he's\Nnever left a single clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pathetic whelp isn't changing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, let's head in. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay outside and wait for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.74,0:09:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My best bet is to take it by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought, I'd better\Nsnatch it without his knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky son of\Na gun, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lunchtime rush beat us here\Nand they're already out of St.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman's sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just our luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're sold out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.32,0:09:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't that a shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you guys, I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I could sell you mine, but so\Nyou know it'll cost you 10,000 yen, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, not a decent bone\Nin your body, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Josuke, looks\Nlike we're headed to Hokuben.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.82,0:09:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure that'll be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt a 500 yen meal and\Na drink will fill us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're better off skipping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my first choice, but\Nthe cafeteria will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, that's where Koichi\Nsaid he's getting lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, that means he'll be\Nthere with Yukako Yamagishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:10:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate having to be the third wheel\Nto those honeymooners' love fest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the food they serve is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.98,0:10:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their nasty meat is so thin,\Nit's practically invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who knows what kind of weird\Nshit they put in the Masa soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we use the equipment\Nroom in my middle school's gym?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has tons of drinks to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our PE teacher always\Nsneaks away to have his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.80,0:10:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coffee and tea in there\Nwhen no one's looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the teachers are in the\Nfaculty room during lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they won't be able to bust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I'll sneak in through the\Nwindow and take a cup to quench my thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go buy lunch and we'll\Nhang out there and eat together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's back up there, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you seriously stealing\Ndrinks from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stingy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you even buy drinks for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never seen me doing\Nsomething that greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, what crawled up there butts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, you better pay me\Nback my thousand yen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for bumping into you sir it's all my\Nfault I wasn't looking where I was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.36,0:11:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry again shit so close he's left his
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,idiotic friends but he's heading back to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.54,0:11:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,school he's eating\Nlunch there so what's my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next move I believe\Nthey call him Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minutes from now he'll open that\Nbag and things will get very
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this is unfathomable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alrighty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that I'm in my special hiding spot,\NI can finally eat my lunch in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.02,0:12:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I almost forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I start chowing down on\Nmy food, I need to make coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a secret trip to the\Ngym without a freshly brewed cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.72,0:12:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortune has smiled on you, Shigechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had you peeked inside, my only recourse\Nwould have been to obliterate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, I think this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's smaller than I thought. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought these two were blowing them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.48,0:12:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to\Nget lunch somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't just pass up\Nfree coffee from Cafe Gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got 500 yen Mega\Nnochi bentos on the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:12:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you two actually showed up\Nto eat after calling me a stingy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a couple of hypocritical pricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, cut us some slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.34,0:13:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard of people\Nchanging their minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a thing that happens, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offing one of them would\Nbe a walk in the park,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't tackle all three at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, I was so close, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's only centimeters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shigechi, you mind grabbing\Nme a drink on your way back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.44,0:13:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And could you make it a\Ngreen tea instead of coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a black tea with milk. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makunochi with milk tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.72,0:13:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, he's going to try to eat his\Nmeal right on top of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something fast, he's going\Nto open the bag right in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.28,0:13:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, not soy sauce again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're always giving me\Nsoy sauce with katsu. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you're supposed to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way. Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows it's tonkatsu sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.48,0:14:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting soy sauce on tonkatsu\Nviolates all that sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.60,0:14:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1back,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\p1\pos(1155.714,63.142)\be0.3}m 0 0 l 800 0 800 1000 0 1000{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1a,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,130)}Morioh Landmark #7
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1b,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,230)}St. Gentlemen Bakery
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1c,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,570)\fs59}Location: Two minute's walk from \Nthe bus stop near Budogaoka \NHigh School. It's the bakery on \Nthe green road leading from the\N station.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.52,0:14:46.53,Episode 10 Typesetting 1d,Eyecatch,0,0,0,,{\pos(1159,980)\fs51}St. Gentlemen is renowned for its \Ndelicious bread cooked inside a \Nstone oven. Typical customers include \Nstudents, housewives, and office \Nladies. Their most popular food item \Nis their sandwiches, which \Nconsistently sell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because from where I'm standing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.86,0:15:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it looks like you're trying to\Nsteal my sandwich out from under me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.52,0:15:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came over here because I\Nthought I heard something weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to check it out\Nand then get back to eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My food's off limits, hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already hear your sappy sob story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teriyaki chicken\Nsandwiches are my favorite,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.54,0:15:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so won't you please give me\Na teeny-weeny bite, Shigechi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I'm wrong, you can't, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, you sure are a greedy\Nlittle stinker, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you focus on\Nbringing out my tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and don't forget my milk tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm making them fast as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get them while they're hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One green tea and one black\Ntea with milk. Oh! Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sandwich disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you lunch thieves do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lunch thieves? Who, us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we didn't have anything to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him, Okuyasu, what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your games!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one else here but us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta know what\Nhappened to my sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, we're telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cross our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.48,0:16:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just as confused\Nabout all this as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew, lying punks. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you gotta make me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.66,0:16:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of you\Npointing the finger at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would we take your sandwich\Nwhen we've got our own?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna lie, then\Nwe'll do things my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is make Harvest\Nturn this room inside out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you are so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine, search the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to, search until\Nyou pass out, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, why would\Nwe steal a stupid sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is torture, what's\Ngoing on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing trapped under here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that pissant is up\Nto, but it can't be anything good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, open up, I know somebody's in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit balls were busted!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the PE teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to bail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't found my sandwich!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouchie-go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No good, hooligans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought my tea and coffee\Nwasn't lasting very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going crazy,\Nbut I was just being used.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to start locking this\Nplace up tighter than Fort Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day has been hellacious,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:18:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but despite every setback, I beat\Nthe odds and have been reunited
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it, but I've always had\Nthe feeling that somewhere out there
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a guardian angel looking\Nover Yoshikage Kira's shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.74,0:18:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That in the end, things\Nwill work out for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I live every day with rigor and\Nboldness, I'll ultimately be delivered from
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a wretched life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a pretty close call today, my dear,\Nbut I knew we'd find our way back to each
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why is someone I've never laid\Neyes on skulking off with my sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while we're on this subject buster,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why is some strange man hanging around my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,school like It's another\Nday at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to be talking\Nto me, would you, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I haven't the faintest\Nidea what you're going on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you must know, I just\Npurchased this item at St.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.14,0:18:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:18:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can save the bullshit\Nthat bags my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could go on and on about\Nhow I know it's mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but someone like you\Nwould never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to take back what's ours, Harvest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bag's being ripped away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.36,0:19:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not my sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that ham come from a real person?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's come to this, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My secret is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interestingly enough, you\Nand I, it would appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we both share a unique power but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see my harvest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Important right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.25,0:19:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you strutting around\Ncarrying a hand in your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're by yourself, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see your playmates anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:19:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe their names\Nwere Josuke and Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.44,0:20:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be safe to assume they\Nboth have powers similar to ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't you move a single muscle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you so much as blink, you're a gutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gutsy and you're some kind of closet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weirdo and I don't want\Nyou coming any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.38,0:20:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know what's good for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just looking at your slimy face\Nis starting to make my skin crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.26,0:20:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're evil. And evil people\Nneed to stay far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm currently 33 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that you'd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,care, but I reside in Northeast\NMorio's Villa District.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I've yet to marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to make a living, I work\Nfor Kameyo Department Stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a long day's work,\NI return home no later
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than 8 p .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like smoking, but do\Nenjoy the occasional drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always in bed by 11 p .m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I make it a point to get no less\Nthan eight hours of sleep each night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before bed, I drink a warm glass of milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always coupled with 20 minutes of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.16,0:21:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stretching to decompress\Nfrom the long work day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.72,0:21:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams are the usual result of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I then awake as refreshed and\Nrecharged as a newborn child,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready to take on the day's?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after my last checkup I was\Ngiven a clean bill of health.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea, creeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.74,0:21:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For as long as I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done everything in my\Npower to live a productive
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life that allows me to\Npursue a lasting inner?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.96,0:21:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may be a foreign concept,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I choose not to concern\Nmyself with winning or losing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life's troubles or enemies\Nwho bring sleepless nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is how I cope with this backwards\Nlife we find ourselves living.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what brings me happiness in a\Nworld fraught with hardship and misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, if I were\Never to engage in combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would win the battle without question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, Shigechi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are an irksome troublemaker\Nwho stands to hinder my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, boy, are the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deadly queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.50,0:22:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I named it myself, and truth be\Ntold, I'm quite proud of the moniker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before you have the chance to\Nutter a word of this to another soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall eradicate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.60,0:22:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep soundly tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can already feel it.
