Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.30,0:22:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a gentle feeling. Take a\Nshelter in the face of my spine,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.85,0:22:58.52,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:22:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,straight like a Chaka cherry cola.
