Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the face of the humic and\Nthe ball that I need to,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to.
