Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.37,0:23:13.99,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.52,0:23:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what\Nhit you when I get to you.
